<title>USA: ADVISORY -- CSCE to publish US coffee stocks daily.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY -- CSCE to publish US coffee stocks daily.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange said on Tuesday it will now update its U.S. certified coffee stock report daily instead of weekly.</p>
<p>CSCE, which began reporting inventory data on a daily basis Monday, did not give a reason for the change.</p>
<p>Reuters will publish the stock data daily after 1500 EST/2000 GMT. </p>
<p>((-- New York Commodities Desk, +1 212 859 1640))</p>
